@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Chat: question with an answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the SLA for P1 incidents on the Enterprise plan?"
}

### Chat: with debug (query plan, retrieved chunks, selected chunks)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the SLA for P1 incidents on the Enterprise plan?",
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: without reranking
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which payment methods does FCAI Cloud accept?",
  "use_rerank": false,
  "debug": true
}

### Chat: ambiguous question (returns needs_clarification=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How does support work on the company plan?"
}

### Chat: answer not in the knowledge base
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the capital of France?"
}

### Chat: empty question (returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "   "
}
